  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Do NOT use generic blue or purple. Stick to the Earthy Terracotta and Bone White palette.",
    "Data density is critical: ensure tables and kanban boards have tight spacing and use IBM Plex Sans.",
    "Headings must use Manrope for a structural, architectural feel.",
    "Use JetBrains Mono for SKUs, inventory counts, and monetary values.",
    "All interactive elements must include a data-testid attribute in kebab-case format.",
    "The login screen should be a 50/50 split on desktop, with the left side using the 'login_hero' image and right side housing the role selector cards and PIN pad.",
    "Kanban board should use slightly darker grey #F4F3EE for column backgrounds and stark white #FDFDFD for cards to create contrast without heavy drop shadows.",
    "Avoid fully rounded pills except for status badges. Use rounded-lg (8px) or rounded-xl (12px) for structural components."
  ]
}